  m_Text: UniStorm's procedural clouds offer both volumetric and 2D options that
    can be changed within the editor or during runtme. Both options require no maximum
    Far Clipping distance so your camera can be set to whatever distance is needed.
    The volumetric clouds option offers AAA quality clouds using the latest shading
    and performance techniques. The 2D cloud option is a great lightweight option
    and offers 4 quality settings to cover a wide range of mobile devices and lower
    end computers.
