  m_Text: 25 unique weather types are included. UniStorm also offers the ability
    to use Weather Type objects to create custom weather types.  Each weather type
    can be customized with its own cloud cover, cloud style, cloud height, particle
    effects, sun intensity, moon intensity, cloud shadow intensity, sound effects,
    wind amount, and various other settings allowing for truly unique and customizable
    weather.  There are no limits to the amount of weather types that can be used!
