  m_Text: UniStorm's clouds are very well optimized and use the latest performance
    and shading techniques to give you AAA clouds at a great frame rate. They feature
    4 quality settings allowing the clouds to perform well on a wide range of devices
    and computers. Each setting is properly calculated to be far more efficient than
    the previous setting. UniStorm's clouds can be dynamically changed during runtime,
    which allows them to be switched with a game's quality setting.
